item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/9b743eaabb740e2f6bd23707b9f64d13.mp4?t=1762717920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: in a world of sex, politics, and betrayal, your greatest weakness might lie in the very arms that please you most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/273512721a8d191c8ac3ac4a2f32cb73.avif?t=1762717920\" width=600 height=559 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/c46e42e47f96d069702f4e465792813a.poster.avif?t=1762717920\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/c46e42e47f96d069702f4e465792813a.webm?t=1762717920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684700/extras/c46e42e47f96d069702f4e465792813a.mp4?t=1762717920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empire of Lust</strong>\ud83c\udfdb   is a visual novel for adults who crave power, intrigue, and unapologetic pleasure \u2014 set against the backdrop of a world where indulgence isn't a sin\u2026 it\u2019s a strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Treasure of the Domus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3684700/73e4ead3dcf1abfa57064f41c0c96c318ef79b5c.jpg"},{"name":"Tied to Pleasure","path":"h